    "### Transfer‑learning – RN18‑TL  \n",
    "A ResNet‑18 initialised with ImageNet weights.  \n",
    "The first RGB convolution is replaced by a single‑channel version  \n",
    "(averaging the pretrained kernels) so the network can ingest greyscale MR slices.  \n",
    "The final fully‑connected layer is swapped for four logits.\n"
   ]
