    "### Double‑head CNN – DH‑CNN  \n",
    "A shared feature extractor feeds two heads:  \n",
    "1. binary tumour‑versus‑healthy decision  \n",
    "2. three‑class tumour subtype prediction  \n",
    "The logits are concatenated into a four‑class output so evaluation\n",
    "remains comparable with the other models.\n"
